LIRA dependency
================

LIRA is a framework that provides a data-flow Intermediate Representation
with Ruby, Python, and Rust bindings.

Repository: https://github.com/ProteusLab/LIRA
Branch:     master

To clone:
    git clone --branch master --depth 1 \
        https://github.com/ProteusLab/LIRA.git ext/lira/LIRA
